cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite its Zenodo archive (concept DOI below, which resolves to the latest
  version). The formalisations of the three classical works prove nothing new about Collatz cycles; nothing in this
  repository excludes a Collatz cycle beyond the published bounds or proves the Collatz conjecture.
title: >-
  One Obstruction, Three Faces — Merle Lean stack, with Lean 4 formalisations of Halbeisen–Hungerbühler 1997,
  Lagarias 1990 and Steiner 1978
